---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { contact } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="What data TOEFLY collects, why, who processes it, how long it is kept and how to export or delete it."
  updated="2026-11-23"
  version="0.1"
>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    TOEFLY is a TOEFL iBT preparation service built by its author as a diploma project. The author is the controller of
    your personal data. For privacy questions and requests, contact us through{' '}
    <a href={contact.href}>{contact.label}</a>. Security issues go through our{' '}
    <a href="https://github.com/graffegiraffe/TOEFLY/security/policy">security policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Account: email, name, time zone, and the sign-in provider if you use Google or Apple.</li>
    <li>Your goal: target score, exam date and daily study time.</li>
    <li>Study activity: answers, scores, time spent, your weeks, your vocabulary and your mistakes.</li>
    <li>Your work: essays, emails, voice recordings and their transcripts, and chats with Toefly Tutor.</li>
    <li>Payments: a customer ID, the plan and the amounts. Card details stay with the payment provider.</li>
    <li>Technical data: a shortened IP address, the app you use and security events such as sign-ins.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To run your account and your study plan, as part of our agreement with you.</li>
    <li>
      To check Writing and Speaking with AI, to chat with Toefly Tutor and to build your weeks, only with your consent.
      Without it, the rest of TOEFLY still works.
    </li>
    <li>To record and score your voice, only with a separate consent.</li>
    <li>To send service emails and study reminders. You can turn reminders off. Marketing emails need your consent.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>AI processing</h2>
  <p>
    Before text goes to an outside AI provider, names, emails, phone numbers and other personal details are masked.
    Audio cannot be masked; it is used to transcribe your answer and score pronunciation, not to identify you. AI scores
    are always marked as an estimate, and a tutor can re-score your work.
  </p>

  <h2>Who processes your data</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Provider</th>
          <th scope="col">What for</th>
          <th scope="col">Where</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>GroqCloud</td>
          <td>AI text checks, chat and speech-to-text (masked text, audio)</td>
          <td>USA</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Microsoft Azure Speech</td>
          <td>Pronunciation scoring and speech synthesis</td>
          <td>EU</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Brevo</td>
          <td>Emails</td>
          <td>EU</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Stripe, bePaid</td>
          <td>Payments</td>
          <td>EU, USA, Belarus</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Cloudflare</td>
          <td>Network, hosting of this page, file storage</td>
          <td>Global</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Oracle Cloud</td>
          <td>Servers</td>
          <td>EU</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Grafana Cloud</td>
          <td>Monitoring, without your content</td>
          <td>EU</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Google, Apple</td>
          <td>Sign-in, if you choose it</td>
          <td>Global</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    If you join a tutor, they see your progress and your work until you leave them. We do not sell your data and show no
    ads.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your account and study data: until you delete your account. Full deletion takes up to 30 days.</li>
    <li>Voice recordings: 90 days.</li>
    <li>Application logs: 14 days. Security logs: 1 year.</li>
    <li>Payment records: as long as the law requires.</li>
    <li>Deleted data can remain in encrypted backups for up to 365 days and is not restored into the service.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can see, correct, export and delete your data, restrict or object to its use, and withdraw any consent at any
    time. Most of this is in the app under Settings, Privacy: export arrives within 24 hours as a JSON archive, and
    account deletion starts at once. Other requests are answered within 30 days. You can also complain to the data
    protection authority where you live.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This page sets no cookies. It saves your theme choice in your browser’s local storage. The web app uses one session
    cookie that it needs to keep you signed in. There are no analytics or advertising cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>Age</h2>
  <p>TOEFLY is for people aged 16 and over.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>When this policy changes, we tell you in the app and ask you to accept the new version.</p>
</Legal>
